    # ------------------------------------------------------------------
    # 07-10 R2-1 / R2-2: provider timeout is threaded into the session AND
    # the fair scheduler barrier ``fut.result(timeout=)`` cancels a hung
    # provider call, recording a terminal ``symbol_timeout``.
